@format 1
@id export.rename-preset
@title Rename export preset
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Validate and commit a requested new name for one custom export preset.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.add-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Preset name committed <input>
- Receive old and edited preset names @ export.PExportNameCommit(...)
> eligible

[eligible] Check rename <decision>
- Protect native presets and reject blank, unchanged, or duplicate requested names @ export.PExportNameCommit(...)
? "Rename is invalid or targets a native preset" > unchanged
? "Requested custom name is usable" > commit

[commit] Rename preset <process>
- Update the preset name, selection, and visible rows @ export.PExportNameCommit(...)
> result

[result] Preset renamed <output>
= The custom preset is available under the requested name.

[unchanged] Name unchanged <output>
= The existing preset name remains active.
